<title>USA: Central Dauphin SD, Pa., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Central Dauphin SD, Pa., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Dauphin School District, Pa., said Wednesday it recalculated Prudential Securities, Inc's winning bid on the District's $10 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the true interest cost was 5.3871 percent reflecting the cost of insurance, not the 5.360 percent originally calculated.</p>
